# Plan (opus, strong)

## Goal

The daily quest pool gets three new quests: `stinkyscape-8` ("Play 8 Stinkyscape cards"), `radiant-upgrade-2` (a new goal kind, `radiantUpgrades`) and `switch-5` (a new goal kind, `positionSwitches`). The two new goals are counted into `GameTally` from the seat's `SeatSummary.radiant_upgrades` / `position_switches` (R1256000), and a record without those fields counts 0. A unit test fails when a set in `SHIPPED_SETS` has no `playSetCards` quest. zh-CN gets the three titles. SPEC §14.9 names the new goals, and ruling R2253000 records how they count and the set-quest rule.

